    "id": 42,
    "title": "Paddle sandbox subscription renews unattended — establish Paddle-side vs site-side driver",
    "status": "todo",
    "priority": "high",
    "created": "2026-08-02T03:43:06.468088561+02:00",
    "updated": "2026-08-05T15:45:14.805502952+02:00",
    "tags": [
      "renewal",
